WEBVTT

NOTE Captions for t1-07-shutdown-recovery.mp3 — machine-transcribed on-device from the existing audio (SR-472). Not proofread.
NOTE Cues with ids phase-recognise/-regulate/-release/-rise mark where each step begins; js/saferise-poster.js reads them.

00:00:02.210 --> 00:00:03.630
Something has gone flat.

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:05.960
And you're still here anyway.

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:08.510
That took more than it looks like.

00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:10.110
From where you're sitting

00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:16.920
This practice starts differently.

00:00:17.140 --> 00:00:19.160
And it asks for very little.

00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:28.000
You may not feel much of any of it today.

00:00:33.110 --> 00:00:34.730
That is expected here.

00:00:35.190 --> 00:00:37.970
And it isn't a sign that it isn't working.

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:40.350
That's the way it happens sometimes.

00:00:40.820 --> 00:00:42.600
Your body goes quiet first.

00:00:49.220 --> 00:00:51.350
That's what it does to protect you.

00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:55.120
The part of you that knows this will pass comes after.

00:00:55.540 --> 00:00:57.880
It's slower and today it's faint.

00:00:58.390 --> 00:00:59.690
But it isn't missing.

00:01:00.250 --> 00:01:03.820
Most of what's hard lives in the gap between the two.

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:13.670
The next few minutes are just here to narrow that gap a little.

00:01:19.490 --> 00:01:21.810
Let's do this in four simple steps.

00:01:22.590 --> 00:01:24.180
You don't need to keep track.

00:01:24.510 --> 00:01:26.040
I'll take you through them.

00:01:26.410 --> 00:01:27.760
Before we start,

00:01:28.020 --> 00:01:28.810
Let's see.

00:01:29.120 --> 00:01:30.550
Can you move your toes?

00:01:30.910 --> 00:01:31.920
And your fingers.

00:01:32.350 --> 00:01:33.910
One hand is plenty.

00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:37.800
If your feet compress gently into whatever is under them

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:39.690
Go ahead and do that now.

00:01:39.950 --> 00:01:41.070
Not too hard.

00:01:41.550 --> 00:01:45.080
Just enough to notice the floors they're holding you.

00:01:45.380 --> 00:01:46.240
That's done.

00:01:46.630 --> 00:01:49.600
Nothing bigger than that is required for a while.

00:01:56.040 --> 00:01:56.820
Step one.

phase-recognise
00:01:57.050 --> 00:01:57.960
Recognise.

00:01:58.660 --> 00:02:01.060
We will start with something very small.

00:02:01.390 --> 00:02:03.910
Describe what you're feeling in just one word.

00:02:04.450 --> 00:02:05.960
Maybe that word is numb.

00:02:06.260 --> 00:02:08.710
Maybe it's flat or heavy or blank.

00:02:09.170 --> 00:02:10.820
That's all this part needs.

00:02:11.290 --> 00:02:15.150
There is no need to search for where it sits in the body.

00:02:20.390 --> 00:02:21.450
In this state

00:02:21.720 --> 00:02:23.840
We won't spend our energy on that.

00:02:24.490 --> 00:02:26.160
Nahm is nothing though

00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:29.230
It's somewhere your body has moved to.

00:02:29.660 --> 00:02:31.660
And it moved there for a reason.

00:02:32.360 --> 00:02:34.330
Something got to be too much.

00:02:34.790 --> 00:02:39.240
It makes sense that your system needs to turn down the volume right now.

00:02:39.690 --> 00:02:41.120
Just for a little while.

00:02:45.980 --> 00:02:49.820
Right now all we have to do is be aware of that.

00:02:50.310 --> 00:02:51.830
You noticed you were in it.

00:02:52.210 --> 00:02:53.560
That's the pot that counts.

00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:55.320
And it's already done.

00:02:55.770 --> 00:02:57.550
You have your attention on it now.

00:02:58.190 --> 00:02:59.010
Step 2

phase-regulate
00:02:59.300 --> 00:03:00.570
Regulate now

00:03:00.830 --> 00:03:02.340
We move to regulation.

00:03:02.600 --> 00:03:04.910
This is not about trying to calm down.

00:03:05.180 --> 00:03:08.000
Feeling flat is not too much feeling.

00:03:08.350 --> 00:03:09.510
It is too little.

00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:11.480
And easy even bread.

00:03:11.810 --> 00:03:13.390
Close to your normal pace.

00:03:13.840 --> 00:03:15.260
6. And warmth at your chest.

00:03:15.820 --> 00:03:18.080
That is what reaches you right now.

00:03:18.520 --> 00:03:22.570
Let's connect with your chest before any counting or breathing cues.

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:31.180
Place a hand over your heart or on your chest.

00:03:36.720 --> 00:03:40.270
Or if that feels like too much, simply hold your own arm.

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:43.370
Whichever is nearer, let it stay there.

00:03:49.880 --> 00:03:53.630
Warmth and weight are what get through when finer things don't.

00:04:00.530 --> 00:04:01.360
Now the bread

00:04:08.530 --> 00:04:10.220
We don't need to count today.

00:04:10.490 --> 00:04:12.540
Just an even bread, boatways.

00:04:12.940 --> 00:04:15.600
Nothing held out longer than feels natural.

00:04:15.930 --> 00:04:17.850
Breathing in and breathing out.

00:04:18.350 --> 00:04:19.890
Another easy breath in.

00:04:20.140 --> 00:04:20.910
And out.

00:04:21.120 --> 00:04:22.090
Take your time.

00:04:28.070 --> 00:04:30.890
Thoughts may come while we sit here, they may not.

00:04:31.300 --> 00:04:33.380
Either one is completely fine.

00:04:38.410 --> 00:04:41.920
If a thought comes, you don't have to do anything with it.

00:04:42.470 --> 00:04:43.660
Let it sit there

00:04:48.710 --> 00:04:50.950
You are the one noticing the thought.

00:04:51.530 --> 00:04:54.560
You are not the one who has to answer it today.

00:04:59.610 --> 00:05:02.400
It's like watching a butterfly enter.

00:05:02.660 --> 00:05:03.990
True one window.

00:05:04.300 --> 00:05:05.970
And exit through another.

00:05:06.340 --> 00:05:07.810
We'll just watch it pass

00:05:14.260 --> 00:05:15.160
Step 3.

phase-release
00:05:15.630 --> 00:05:16.240
Release

00:05:22.760 --> 00:05:24.880
There is the shut down state itself.

00:05:25.380 --> 00:05:28.530
And then there is something quiet or running underneath it.

00:05:29.010 --> 00:05:30.460
You know that second voice

00:05:31.040 --> 00:05:36.600
The one whispering that this is pathetic or lazy or that everyone else
manages.

00:05:37.230 --> 00:05:41.660
It runs all day low at a volume you've almost stopped hearing.

00:05:42.190 --> 00:05:44.420
But it isn't gentler for being quiet.

00:05:44.930 --> 00:05:47.710
It is the same pressure as the louder states.

00:05:48.270 --> 00:05:50.270
Just spoken in a lower voice.

00:05:57.330 --> 00:05:59.710
The shutdown state can stay for now.

00:05:59.950 --> 00:06:02.690
It arrived, it isn't being argued with.

00:06:03.090 --> 00:06:07.430
And it isn't being ranked against how you felt last week or last month.

00:06:12.960 --> 00:06:15.280
Instead, put down that second voice.

00:06:15.970 --> 00:06:17.380
Put down the judgment.

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:20.340
And put down the constant question.

00:06:20.950 --> 00:06:23.440
What's wrong with me that I can't function?

00:06:31.180 --> 00:06:33.020
You've been asking that all week

00:06:33.640 --> 00:06:35.920
And it hasn't given you anything helpful.

00:06:36.440 --> 00:06:39.350
Shutting down is simply what a body does.

00:06:39.770 --> 00:06:42.870
When what's arriving is more than it can meet.

00:06:43.420 --> 00:06:45.550
I'm pushing back isn't an option.

00:06:45.860 --> 00:06:47.050
It is protection.

00:06:47.490 --> 00:06:50.980
Expensive protection for protection nonetheless

00:06:51.620 --> 00:06:53.440
What was this protection for?

00:06:53.880 --> 00:06:55.920
You don't need the answer right now.

00:06:56.230 --> 00:06:59.450
Keep the question gently, but set it aside.

00:06:59.990 --> 00:07:03.070
It's worth coming back to later when you're steadier.

00:07:08.880 --> 00:07:11.110
Some of this weight belongs to today.

00:07:11.480 --> 00:07:13.070
Some of it may be older.

00:07:13.380 --> 00:07:15.940
You don't have to sort out which is which yet.

00:07:20.900 --> 00:07:22.710
Just notice there might be boat

00:07:29.320 --> 00:07:30.160
Step 4.

phase-rise
00:07:30.680 --> 00:07:34.510
Rise picture yourself from across the room right now.

00:07:39.380 --> 00:07:41.810
And on your chest or holding your arm.

00:07:42.200 --> 00:07:43.650
You're shut down today.

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:46.140
But you still stayed through these minutes.

00:07:46.550 --> 00:07:49.940
To connect this quiet state to your heart anyway.

00:07:56.390 --> 00:07:58.530
Now, pick your aversion of yourself.

00:07:58.790 --> 00:08:00.950
That you'd want to be on a day like this

00:08:01.430 --> 00:08:04.030
Not back to full energy, not fixed.

00:08:04.390 --> 00:08:06.640
Just choosing one very small thing.

00:08:07.080 --> 00:08:07.880
Standing up.

00:08:08.260 --> 00:08:12.100
Drinking a glass of water, opening a window for fresh air.

00:08:12.480 --> 00:08:14.940
Visualize just one small action

00:08:15.350 --> 00:08:17.560
That is where your attention can go next.

00:08:18.130 --> 00:08:22.960
Once you've done it later notice that you did it. Write it down if you can.

00:08:23.180 --> 00:08:25.550
One more easy, even bread.

00:08:31.680 --> 00:08:32.960
The same lengthen

00:08:33.320 --> 00:08:34.020
And out.

00:08:39.470 --> 00:08:44.920
Notice how you are right now, feeling nothing different is very common here.

00:08:50.890 --> 00:08:53.520
And it does mean nothing happened.

00:09:01.070 --> 00:09:03.660
Gently move your hands and feet.

00:09:04.210 --> 00:09:06.100
Take your time getting up

00:09:11.090 --> 00:09:14.300
Open your eyes whenever you feel ready
